ple_name":"闞止","people_name_jianti_auto":"阚止","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1f1-db0e-11ef-bd40-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"簡公","people_name_jianti_auto":"简公","start_index":71,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1f2-db0e-11ef-9419-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"闞","people_name_jianti_auto":"阚","start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1f3-db0e-11ef-a8f8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"蘇代","people_name_jianti_auto":"苏代","start_index":81,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1f4-db0e-11ef-bf3c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"犀首","people_name_jianti_auto":"犀首","start_index":87,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1f5-db0e-11ef-95ad-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"張儀","people_name_jianti_auto":"张仪","start_index":98,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1f6-db0e-11ef-afcc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1f7-db0e-11ef-948a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉國","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋国","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1f8-db0e-11ef-af14-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":85,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1f9-db0e-11ef-a731-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"韓","place_name_jianti_auto":"韩","start_index":92,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1fa-db0e-11ef-a49e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":95,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1fb-db0e-11ef-95da-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":103,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1fc-db0e-11ef-bea4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":126,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1fd-db0e-11ef-a7c6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"晉六卿，智氏、范氏、中行氏、趙氏、韓氏、魏氏也。自晉文、襄以來，迭秉國政，後皆強大，卒分晉國。齊簡公使闞止爲政，陳成子憚之；已而陳常殺闞止，弒簡公。闞，以邑爲氏。蘇代曰：魏相犀首，必右韓而左魏；相張儀，必右秦而左魏。蓋二相外各倚與國以爲重而內爭權，所以魏日削也。闞，戶監翻。行，戶剛翻。恆，戶登翻。卒，子恤翻。相，息亮翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"晋六卿，智氏、范氏、中行氏、赵氏、韩氏、魏氏也。自晋文、襄以来，迭秉国政，后皆强大，卒分晋国。齐简公使阚止为政，陈成子惮之；已而陈常杀阚止，弑简公。阚，以邑为氏。苏代曰：魏相犀首，必右韩而左魏；相张仪，必右秦而左魏。盖二相外各倚与国以为重而内争权，所以魏日削也。阚，户监翻。行，户刚翻。恒，户登翻。卒，子恤翻。相，息亮翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"8c4774a6-db0e-11ef-9826-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-481,"link_td_description":"齐简公，姜姓，名壬，齐悼公之子。","link_td_id":"Q10001704","link_td_number_id":330156,"people_name":"齊簡公","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐简公","people_xingming":"姜壬","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8c49c202-db0e-11ef-928c-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[姜壬]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷五十二）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"[吕氏曰：秦孝公用商鞅，取河西地。其尽得河西，则犀首张仪...","context_before":"...年，魏纳上郡十五县[今延安以北地]，而河西之地尽入于秦。","source_end_index":425,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8e5a0768-dfec-539f-9b20-8e795d4ab86a","source_start_index":396,"source_text":"《战国策》：摎留谓韩王，魏两用犀首张仪，而西河之外亡。是也"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷五十二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"5韓宣惠王欲兩用公仲、公叔爲政，問於繆留。對曰：「不可，晉用六卿而國分；齊簡公用陳成子及闞止而見殺；魏用犀首、張儀而西河之外亡。今君兩用之，其多力者內樹黨，其寡力者藉外權。羣臣有內樹黨以驕主，有外爲交以削地，君之國危矣。」","content_fanyi":"韩宣惠王想同时任用公仲和公叔两人执掌国政，便向缪留询问。缪留回答说：“不可以，晋国任用六卿，国家因而分裂；齐简公任用陈成子和阚止，自身因而被杀；魏国任用犀首、张仪，西河以外的土地因而丧失。如今您要同时任用这两人，他们中力量强的一方便会在国内树立党羽，力量弱的一方便会向外借助他国权势。群臣中有的在国内树立党羽以欺凌君主，有的对外结交以削减国土，您的国家就危险了。”","content_jianti_auto":"5韩宣惠王欲两用公仲、公叔为政，问于缪留。对曰：「不可，晋用六卿而国分；齐简公用陈成子及阚止而见杀；魏用犀首、张仪而西河之外亡。今君两用之，其多力者内树党，其寡力者藉外权。群臣有内树党以骄主，有外为交以削地，君之国危矣。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":223,"number":5,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二 (周紀二) / 顯王 / 四十八年 / 第 9 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8c4774a4-db0e-11ef-a485-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-321},"tongjian_id":"8c4774a4-db0e-11ef-a485-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":2,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[{"decision_name":"是否采纳李斯对赵高的弹劾","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_8DACF60EDB0E11EFBF91A0D3651F611F_01"},{"decision_name":"如何应对李斯的弹劾以自保","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_8DACF60EDB0E11EFBF91A0D3651F611F_02"}],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"事見左傳。卒，子恤翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"事见左传。卒，子恤翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"8dacf60f-db0e-11ef-a542-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"厭，於鹽翻；後以義推。","note_content_jianti_auto":"厌，于盐翻；后以义推。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":101,"tongjian_id":"8dacf612-db0e-11ef-bcb6-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"趙高","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵高","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8dacf614-db0e-11ef-bcd5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"言趙高居中用事，其位列權勢次於人主也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"言赵高居中用事，其位列权势次于人主也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":111,"tongjian_id":"8dacf613-db0e-11ef-8ccf-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[{"chapter_global_index":6,"chapter_name":"考证篇第六","chenzhu_chapter":"胡注长于地理及考证，今日学者无不知。书名《表微》，非微何必表也？曰：考证为史学方法之一，欲实事求是，非考证不可。彼毕生从事考证，以为尽史学之能事者固非；薄视考证以为不足道者，亦未必是也。兹特辑存数十条，以备史学之一法，固知非大义微言所在也。","chenzhu_index_in_chapter":2,"chenzhu_text":"史阙无徵，即以李斯书为徵，并可以补史之阙也。","created_at":"2025-12-31 08:50:44","seq_in_chapter":7,"tongjian_id":"CH06-CZ002"}],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"悼公","people_name_jianti_auto